'''Doug Hoppock''' is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was an [[offensive lineman]] for one season with the [[Kansas City Chiefs]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL). He played [[college football]] for the [[Kansas State Wildcats football|Kansas State Wildcats]].<ref>[https://www.pro-football-reference.com/players/H/HoppDo20.htm Doug Hoppock NFL & AFL Football Statistics - Pro-Football-Reference.com]</ref>

