'''Doudow Innocent''' (born July 9, 1972) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[running back]] for one season with the [[Seattle Seahawks]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL). He played [[college football]] for the [[Ole Miss Rebels football|Ole Miss Rebels]].
